00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:51.580
The Little Prince and the Legendary Hero

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:51.580
The Little Prince and the Legendary Hero

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:51.580
The Little Prince and the Legendary Hero

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:51.580
It's another pleasant autumn day in Galette!

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:56.510
Leo-sama's had a very exciting engagement meeting this year.

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:01.930
Prince Lief of Saint Halver, who came extremely close to defeating her,

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:03.470
is now the talk of the town!

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:09.390
Did you sleep well?

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.270
Yes.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.400
Thank you.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.900
Since you came all the way from Halver,

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:18.900
You should have a look around Galette and central Flonyard.

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:21.910
Yes, I'd love to!

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:25.240
I'll meet again with you later tonight.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.620
See you then.

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.160
I'll see you then!

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.540
So...

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:34.920
you're going to be showing me around?

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.170
Yeah!

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:39.470
Come over and talk to the knights sometime.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:42.930
I bet they'd love to talk to a tough guy like you.

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:43.890
Right!

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.680
Can't you come with us, Gaul?

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:49.480
Can't. I've got work to do.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.690
And hey, this guy may be small, but he's a prince.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.900
Don't go acting <i>too</i> friendly with him.

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:56.440
Oh, right.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.240
It's all right, since you're older than me.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.650
Besides, I'm off duty right now.

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:05.580
Just treat me like Vert's relative or something.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:06.200
You sure?

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.370
That makes things easier.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.080
Well, we <i>are</i> distant relatives.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.420
Oh, well.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.460
Just don't mess around too much.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:16.960
Keep an eye on them, 'kay?

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.590
Got it, Gaul-sama.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:23.890
First things first!

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.180
Let's have some food!

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.720
It's every Galettian knight's favorite!

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:32.350
Enjoy the Sea Serpent Restaurant's special lunch!

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:38.480
All the fish is freshly caught.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:41.490
Even our fishermen love to come here!

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:45.620
All right, I have the Hero's Special Soup!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:50.040
And this is a special soup recipe 
from Earth that Nanami taught us!

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:54.620
It's based off a popular dish called bouillabaisse.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:56.630
It's so international!

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:59.880
All right, let's dig in before it gets cold!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:02.130
Let's eat!

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:07.140
A boy's gotta eat a lot and get strong!

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:08.550
Yeah!

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:09.390
Here.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.520
Watch out, it's hot!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.020
Thank you!

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.570
It's delicious!

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:21.820
Right?

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:26.160
This is the castle town around Vendetta Castle.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:30.660
A lot of the souvenirs I got for you are from here.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:31.950
Yeah?

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.790
And if you go into some of the back streets...

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:40.840
you can find some simpler, more affordable stuff.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.210
I like it.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.300
The town is so alive!

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.300
Oh, if it isn't Nanami-chan and Génoise!

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.640
Check it out!

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.220
We've got a good batch today!

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.600
That looks good!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:55.810
We're showing a relative of Vert's around, so maybe later.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:56.810
Gotcha!

00:04:57.350 --> 00:04:59.690
You come and visit us sometime, okay, honey?

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.230
O-Okay!

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:07.860
This is where our knights train.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:11.700
Is it really okay for a foreigner like me to be here?

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:12.950
It's fine!

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:15.000
We're escorting you.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.960
Shinku has been here too, hasn't he?

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:25.010
The council rooms look like this in Halver too, right?

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:25.630
Yeah.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:28.840
We have all kinds of meetings and presentations in them.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:32.850
Leo-sama and Gaul do their stuff right here!

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.640
Jaune, too.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.890
I'm doin' my best.

00:05:37.890 --> 00:05:40.230
I heard that you're going to be a general!

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.860
I dunno yet.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:46.400
But if it means that I can do more for Galette,

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.490
I'd be really happy!

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:49.610
I know how you feel!

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.410
Second company, fire!

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.460
First company, fire!

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.880
This is really intense.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:08.510
It's a lot of people for a mock battle, isn't it?

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:11.550
That company is being led by Gaul-sama.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.560
And we have people from Biscotti with us, too.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:18.020
Shinku and Eclair-chan are right at the front.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.770
The company closer to us is being led by General Godwin.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:24.980
Where is he?

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:25.780
Over there.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.650
Godwin!

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:30.280
Sup, Godwin?

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.030
Hey.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.870
What're you all here for?

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.280
Who's the boy?

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:39.290
Weren't you at the engagement meeting?

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:43.540
I got home from an expedition late last night, went to sleep, and came straight here.

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:45.800
So you didn't even watch the news?

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:51.880
"We had an exciting engagement meeting this year, but not one challenger won."

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:53.550
Am I missing something?

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:56.680
You missed the little bit after that!

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:58.140
What little bit?

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:02.900
Oh, the young man who lost but fought incredibly well?

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:08.440
He must have been incredibly strong to have nearly defeated Lord Leo.

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:10.700
I'd love to meet him.

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:13.030
Well, here he is!

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:13.950
What?

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.830
Nice to meet you, General.

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:18.830
My name is Lief Langue-de-Chat Halver,

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:22.120
from the kingdom of Saint Halver.

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:25.710
<i>He's</i> the guy who nearly beat Lord Leo!

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:27.460
He's a relative of mine,

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.090
and the prince of Halver.

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:32.970
I-I have been incredibly rude.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.510
Forgive me, your highness!

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:36.970
It's nothing to worry about.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:40.930
I'm here to have a look at Galette,

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:42.390
not for any official work.

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:44.100
U-Understood.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.900
Loosen up, Godwin.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.360
He's a cool guy!

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:50.030
Perhaps you lot are just <i>too</i> loose!

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:55.070
General, mind if Prince Lief and I 
borrow the training grounds for a bit?

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:56.950
Sure, of course.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:59.160
We'll be on our lunch break soon.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:05.120
Please show my men how you two fight.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:09.210
I'll relay the information to Lord Gaul and Shinku.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:09.840
Go!

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:10.630
Yessir!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:15.220
Let's show these people how to fight!

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:16.390
All right!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.600
Listen up, soldiers!

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:29.360
Have you all witnessed Lord Leo's recent engagement meeting?

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.860
Yeah!

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:36.410
This is Prince Lief, the man who gave us an incredible show.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:40.280
Today, Prince Lief and our hero

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:42.450
will be sparring for us right here!

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:43.660
Yep!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:48.420
Soldiers, watch them carefully and try to learn a thing or two!

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.880
All right!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:54.170
This is some pretty good lunchtime entertainment we have today.

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:54.920
For real.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:59.090
All right, I'm ready!

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:01.310
Give us a second!

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:03.930
Hey, Vert...

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:05.180
It's fine...

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.190
Wanna bet?

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:10.730
I'm betting on our hero.

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.860
Then I'll take Prince Lief!

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:13.820
What about you?

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:17.200
I don't gamble.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:19.200
Come on, Eclair...

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:20.950
But, I suppose...

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:24.200
I am interested in who will win.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:27.460
Ready?

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.080
Yes!

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.790
Begin!

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.170
Let's go!

00:09:58.450 --> 00:09:59.950
Water God Palm!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:07.580
What?!

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.630
Not bad.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:20.840
Wow.

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.340
Not many people would have survived that.

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:24.720
She's good at dodging, huh?

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:25.600
Yeah.

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.520
I'm just a guest to this world,

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:35.190
but I wanna be your friend, Prince!

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:37.690
I would love to, hero!

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:40.360
Just call me by my name!

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:43.780
Then do the same for me, Nanami-san!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:45.950
All right, Lief!

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:51.710
I'll support your love for Leo-sama!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:55.090
Uh, I don't know if it's "love"...

00:10:55.420 --> 00:11:00.760
However, I'm Leo-sama's hero, 
so I want to be with her forever.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:03.090
Are you okay with that?

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:04.850
Of course!

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:10.100
I don't know Leo-sama enough quite yet,

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:16.360
but I <i>do</i> know that her smile 
has become brighter since you came here.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.190
In my eyes, at least.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.860
That's my answer to your question.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.160
Thanks, Lief.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.620
But we'd better get back to fighting!

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:27.620
Yes!

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.290
Ready, Lief?

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.080
Take this!

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.940
Their finishing blows clashed head-on!

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:03.780
Let's see who's still standing!

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.040
I can't make it...

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:20.460
It's a tie!

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:23.550
Prince Lief, the Galettian Knights are grateful for your performance!

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:24.840
Darn.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:27.760
I couldn't win, but it was fun!

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:29.050
I'll get you next time!

00:12:29.050 --> 00:12:30.680
He's pretty good!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.520
Yeah, it was exciting!

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.640
Wanna have a go, Gaul?

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:36.310
Sounds good to me!

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:41.860
Prince Lief, would you like to fight me?

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:44.610
We could have a team match for round two!

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:46.410
We want to join!

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:47.320
Sounds good!

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:48.950
Join us, Godwin!

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:50.580
M-Me?

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:51.950
Sorry.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.830
This is starting to get out of hand.

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:55.960
It's okay.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.330
I'm enjoying it.

00:12:57.670 --> 00:13:02.090
Oh, we'll be headed to Biscotti after this.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:06.050
Is there anything you want to see,
or maybe someone you want to meet?

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.010
Yes, actually.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.320
Do we have guests?

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:25.110
Hina-sama!

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:26.610
How've you been?

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:27.860
Nanami-dono!

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:29.620
And Génoise!

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.990
Who's this?

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.080
Nice to meet you.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:37.000
This is Prince Lief from Halver.

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:41.170
We told him about you, and he said he'd love to meet you.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.800
Excellent.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:46.340
It's a small place, but make yourself at home.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.340
Thank you!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.430
Good boy.

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:57.100
Because Halver is so far up north on the continent,

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:00.600
I tend to be ignorant about issues going on down here.

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:04.610
That is why I'm visiting the three countries,

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:10.240
with the permission of Lord Leonmitchelli, Princess Millhiore, and Princess Couvre.

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:16.120
Lord D'Arquien, I have heard that you are a mercenary of Biscotti

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.120
and the greatest swordsman on the continent.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:23.170
I've also heard that you fought
alongside the Hero King long ago!

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.550
Words cannot describe how happy I am to see you!

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:30.970
The "greatest swordsman" title is all just some foolish exaggeration.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.760
You'll find great swordsmen everywhere.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.510
Y-Yes, but—

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:39.940
Anyway, you won't last the whole day if you're that nervous.

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:41.520
Take it easy.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:43.270
Y-Yes, Ma'am.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.520
Okay!

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:47.030
I made tea for you all!

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:48.440
Thanks!

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:49.530
Awesome!

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:50.780
Thank you!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.490
Come on, Jaune-chan, Noir-chan!

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.280
Okay!

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:56.290
Snack time!

00:14:57.490 --> 00:15:03.040
Would you like to hear some stories of the Hero King?

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:05.790
Yes, I would love to.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:10.170
Now that I think of it, there's quite a bit to talk about.

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:13.800
You're visiting Pastillage later today, right?

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:14.680
Yes!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:15.800
We're all going!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:20.140
You should probably ask Adele, then.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.810
I'll send her a message.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.730
I-It wouldn't be too much trouble?

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.440
Of course not.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:31.400
I'm sure she'd be happy that a young man like you is interested in her stories.

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:32.820
Thank you so much!

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:35.870
I have special Fugetsu-an sweet buns for you!

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:38.080
Eat it while it's warm!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.700
Thanks!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:44.040
I know we're going to Pastillage,

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.540
but is there something going on there?

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.840
Oh, you haven't heard?

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:52.970
There's an exciting event going on, starring the princess!

00:15:54.760 --> 00:16:00.140
Negai wa kitto kanau kara

00:15:54.760 --> 00:16:00.140
Our wish will surely come true

