00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:10.900
We spent so many days together

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:16.870
Te to te tsunaide kawashita yakusoku

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:16.870
We made a promise as we held hands

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:19.490
Kitto kanau

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:19.490
It'll surely come true

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:29.500
itsu datte koko de matteru

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:29.500
I'll always be waiting for you

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.630
Thank you so much!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:36.680
We're here at Pastillage's National Theater!

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:41.010
Let's have a great night together!

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:52.480
issho ni sugoshita ano hi no sora no hoshi wo wasurenai

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:52.480
I won't forget the starry sky of that day

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.440
Princess Millhiore is amazing!

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:49.230
There's still much more to come.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:49.900
Yeah!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:57.910
oshiete kureta ne atsui

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:57.910
You told me about your...

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:03.660
Good evening, ladies and gentlemen.

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:06.500
Princess Millhiore should be here any—

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:10.590
Good evening!

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:15.170
Thank you for coming today!

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:20.970
It was another great concert tonight.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:24.060
Thank you so much for your support!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:29.940
We've prepared a light meal and refreshments for our guests.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:35.110
Please help yourselves while our Princess makes her rounds to greet everyone.

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:42.950
We have concerts in Halver as well,

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:45.200
but nothing this exciting!

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:49.120
Yeah, the princess's concerts have something special about them!

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:50.330
Prince Lief!

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:52.090
Princess Millhiore!

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:53.840
Thank you for coming.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.420
I enjoyed it very much.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.670
You were amazing!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:00.720
He was waving his glow sticks the whole time.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.220
That's great to hear!

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.220
Thank you!

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:05.470
I had so much fun!

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:09.850
It'd be nice if I could sing in Halver sometime.

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:11.060
Yes, definitely!

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:12.730
Our people will surely love it!

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:14.980
Hero Shinku.

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:19.860
Some people from Orange and Dragée said that they would like to see you.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:22.120
Really?

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:25.740
Could you come with the princess?

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:26.500
Sure.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:28.120
I'll see you later, Prince Lief.

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:29.160
Until then.

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:30.000
Right.

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:36.880
Wow...

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:40.550
Leo-sama!

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:43.390
I heard from D'Arquien.

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:45.600
You're going to visit Adele-sama after this?

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:47.140
Yes, that's right.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:50.520
Couvre and I will go with you.

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:54.150
I'm interested in the Hero King's stories as well.

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:54.820
Okay!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:58.530
I'm surprised you were interested in these things!

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:02.450
The Hero King is famous in Halver as well!

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:07.910
So, Grandmother,

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:12.710
I'd like you to share some of your stories with our guests!

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:14.420
That's fine.

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:17.920
I suppose Valery should be there, too?

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:18.920
Definitely!

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:23.180
Okay, I know a place that's perfect for storytelling.

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:27.680
Valery, are you listening?

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:28.600
Yeah.

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:32.440
Couvre's friends would like to hear some stories about us.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:35.060
Would you mind joining us?

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:39.030
I'm doing some research for once right now.

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:41.700
Now, now, don't be rude.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.820
Hina will be coming, too.

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.660
Pretty please!

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.240
Oh, fine.

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:49.950
We'll be there in a few minutes.

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:54.250
I'll bring you your favorite hot tea!

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:56.460
Right, thanks.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:02.260
Storytelling, huh?

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:08.560
This way!

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:10.430
The Hero King, Adele-sama,

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:12.230
and the Demon King, Valery-dono...

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:13.730
I'm getting nervous!

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:15.850
No need for that!

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:17.980
They're my family, after all.

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.160
Grandmother!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:35.210
Welcome to our library.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:38.000
You're the ones who wanted to hear the stories?

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:39.500
Y-Yes!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:42.380
Please come in and take a seat.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:43.720
Okay!

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:45.510
Maids, prepare the tea!

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:46.800
Yes, Ma'am.

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:49.800
Quite the atmosphere you've created here.

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:52.140
Nah, I just happened to already be here.

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:58.360
We old people enjoy telling stories to the younger ones.

00:20:58.360 --> 00:20:59.650
Don't you think so, too?

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:01.400
Well, yes...

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:05.900
Where are the heroes and your princess?

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:07.240
They've got some work to take care of.

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:08.870
They'll be here in a bit—

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:10.530
Shortly.

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:18.540
All right, now that everyone's settled down,

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:21.800
we'll be telling you about the olden days.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:24.090
Long, long ago,

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:27.470
I was traveling with four other people.

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:30.680
I was with Valery here,

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.180
Hina, a swordsman,

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:38.190
Isuka, the blacksmith who's probably out drinking who-knows-where,

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:40.440
and finally...

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:45.070
The last princess and lord of Pastillage...

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:49.700
The woman who summoned me to Flonyard...

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:52.280
Clarifie Eins Pastillage.

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:59.460
We called her "Fie."

